      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quoi donc ? Me cherchez-vous querelle ?\nSachez que je suis prêt à relever le défi.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Êtes-vous du genre à vous approcher de\nvotre adversaire en combat, tel un butor ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Personnellement, je me tiens à distance,\navec aplomb et stratégie.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006500720073006F006E006E0065006C006C0065006D0065006E0074002C0020006A00650020006D00650020007400690065006E0073002000E0002000640069007300740061006E00630065002C000A0061007600650063002000610070006C006F006D006200200065007400200073007400720061007400E9006700690065002E00100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je m’assure toujours que mon Pokémon\nreste hors de portée des manants.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Certes, les capacités à distance mettent\ndavantage de temps à se recharger...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, mais quel étourdi ! Je parle trop !\nMieux vaut illustrer ce discours en pratique.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lorsque vous vous sentirez en mesure de recevoir\ncette leçon, adressez-moi la parole.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eh bien ? Prêt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe à recevoir une correction ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500680020006200690065006E0020003F00200050007200EA007400100003110000FF01000065002000E0002000720065006300650076006F0069007200200075006E006500200063006F007200720065006300740069006F006E0020003F00100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On va voir qui va corriger l’autre !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006E00200076006100200076006F00690072002000710075006900200076006100200063006F0072007200690067006500720020006C201900610075007400720065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un instant, s’il vous plaît.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E00200069006E007300740061006E0074002C0020007320190069006C00200076006F0075007300200070006C006100EE0074002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je n’ai pas que cela à faire !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020006E20190061006900200070006100730020007100750065002000630065006C0061002000E00020006600610069007200650020002100100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je vais me battre de ma façon préférée :\nà distance, loin de la fange !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... Vous n’êtes pas totalement un<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe débutant<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002E00200056006F007500730020006E201900EA007400650073002000700061007300200074006F00740061006C0065006D0065006E007400200075006E00100003110000FF010000650020006400E90062007500740061006E007400100003110000FF01000065002E002E002E00100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hélas ! Les capacités à distance mettent\nun certain temps à se recharger...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les capacités à courte portée, quant à elles,\nimposent de se rapprocher de l’adversaire.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si votre style de combat est de rester proche de\nl’adversaire, de telles capacités vous seront utiles.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais je laisse ces balourdises à la plèbe ! Je reste\nà distance, là où je peux savourer ma stratégie.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Car ne nous mentons pas... vous avez vu les\nPokémon de près, en combat ? Ils font peur !!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les capacités à distance prennent du temps, et\ncelles au corps à corps se rechargent rapidement.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nLe tout est de savoir lesquelles utiliser\nau bon moment !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
